summary: Added `gnomon dev local` (the dev root signs the local lane config with a pinned gnomon-local runner). The probe now reads Ollama's context. The Windows local profile handles node in Program Files. The GUI renders gnomon-local replies and labels them "local model". On an RTX 4050 6 GB / 12 GB RAM laptop, qwen3.5:9b (Q4, ~6.6 GB, 45% CPU offload) with a 16K-context Modelfile variant routed as capable (tools + ctx), and in a Low sandboxed session ran list_files + read_file and answered in ~21 s.
