decisions:
  - id: WL-model
    decision: qwen3.5:9b with num_ctx 16384 (qwen3.5-9b-16k) is the local model on the founder's Windows laptop
    rationale: Founder asked for code + tool calls even if slow; it is the strongest tools/thinking model that runs on 6 GB VRAM + 12 GB RAM; Ollama's default 4096 context is below the lane's 8192 floor
errors_encountered:
  - description: Probe reported ctx unknown on Ollama (no /slots or /props), so the lane refused
    resolution: Read /api/show num_ctx, else /api/ps context_length
  - description: localRunnerDenies put the node prefix at C:\Program Files (POSIX two-up rule); the deny could not be placed and the session refused
    resolution: Windows prefix is node.exe's dir; out-of-root write denies are soft at Low integrity
  - description: GUI showed 'done · 0 tokens' and no reply for local sessions
    resolution: lineItems renders message_end and tool_execution_start; re-embed the bundle (build.mjs --embed)
  - description: Python edits on Windows rewrote files with CRLF, breaking source-text tests
    resolution: Restore LF; prefer the Edit tool
